Description: Python 3 importer for XDF (Extensible Data Format) files
 XDF (Extensible Data Format) is the native on-disk container of the Lab
 Streaming Layer (LSL): a general-purpose format for multi-stream, multi-rate
 time series with rich per-stream metadata, used to store recordings of EEG,
 eye tracking, motion capture, markers and other biosignals.
 .
 pyxdf loads XDF files into Python, dejittering irregular time stamps and
 aligning streams onto a common clock. This package provides the pyxdf module.
